  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Add and mix all components except for OADC. Bring to a boil to dissolve agar and autoclave at 121ºC. Cool to 50-55ºC and aseptically OADC."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
